#   Upstream: https://github.com/joshleaves/ghidra-snes (which vendors, near-verbatim,
#             https://github.com/achan1989/ghidra-65816 by @achan1989 and @greg-kennedy)
#   Commit:   d33ce5dbfbc3645f00449be1c7ca1c1c65e81756
